  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Development of an Orientation Programme for Household Employers in Bahrain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to develop a tailored programme designed to enhance employers&apos; capacity to engage in fair and ethical recruitment, better manage employee-employer relations, while strengthening the role of companies and institutions in protecting domestic workers, and advocating for the introduction of mandatory employer orientation in the domestic work sector. Bringing together the International Organization for Migration (IOM) and the International Labour Organization (ILO), this project builds on the strong partnership between the UN, the LMRA and the UK Embassy in Bahrain to promote the labour and human rights of migrant workers in the Kingdom.</narrative>
  </description>
